# Keep the build context small and secrets out of the image.
#
# .env matters most: it holds SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY and the Bunny Stream
# key. It is passed in at run time (--env-file) so it never becomes an image
# layer — layers persist even if a later step deletes the file.
node_modules
dist
.env
.env.*
*.log

# Never needed inside the image, and .git in particular would drag the whole
# history into the build context.
.git
.gitignore
README.md
